## Experience and Lessons
|Case|:comment_on_thread
Error Analysis1: Unable to locate the element "New Thread Title".
Improvement Guidance1: Similar to the previous case, this failure is due to the absence of the thread that should have been created in the `test_create_new_thread`. Ensure that thread creation is functioning correctly.
Error Analysis2: The test fails because it expects the title to contain "Discussion Threads," but the actual title is "Forum."
Improvement Guidance2: As with the previous tests, ensure that thread creation is functioning correctly. Consider adding assertions to check for the successful creation of threads before proceeding to view or comment on them. This will help isolate issues and prevent cascading failures in dependent tests.

